 ahead of their  time also the motherboard is alive wait  did we forget to mention that  scp-003-1 has displayed at least a low  level of sentience during testing by the  foundation not enough to be considered  an active threat unless certain  conditions make it dangerous the second  component of  scp-003 is 003-2  a stone tablet that 003-1 was attached  to when it was first discovered the  surface of 003-2 has a number of runes  carved into it but these symbols don't  match letters or characters from any  known language the runes on 003-2 are  also known to regularly emit a pale  flickering pattern of light now you're  probably asking how is a slab of stone  able to light itself up well that is  because  scp-003-2 has an internal computer  controlling it and not one composed of  organic parts like hair and fingernails  somewhere within the stone is a  non-biological computer fueled by some  unknown anomalous power source the  foundation's researchers can't access  the internal components of  scp-003-2 without running the high risk  of damaging it but as far as they can  tell whatever is running this bizarre  machine has been slowly losing power for  centuries the biological motherboard is  also known to emit measurable levels of  heat light and radiations of an  anomalous nature so why would someone go  to the trouble of creating a computer  out of living parts and anomalous stone  and what is the purpose of the  biological motherboard the scp  foundation considers it highly probable  that the stone slab of 003-2 was  actually created with the intention of  keeping the motherboard component  003-1 contained additionally during  testing foundation researchers have been  able to exact partially complete data  from scp-003  this data seems to refer to some sort of  potential catastrophe either in the  future or one that has already occurred  as a direct result of scp-003-1  it would seem that  003-1 and 003-2 must stay combined in  order to prevent what the foundation  would deem an lk class restructuring  event how could the biological  motherboard cause an event like this it  just sounds like a partially alive flesh  circuit on a stone slab it's when the  temperature around scp-003 drops below  35 degrees celsius that things start to  get really strange from the minute they  detect a decrease in temperature both  components of scp-003 begin to react the  biological motherboard itself starts to  grow rapidly increasing its overall size  003-1 fuels this growth state by  absorbing any nearby matter adding  anything close enough to its fleshing  mass first it will assimilate any  inorganic material everything from  particles in the atmosphere on up  003-1 transforms these new additions to  itself into the same organic matter that  makes up the biological motherboard  transforming metal or plastic into dead  skin cells hair chitin enamel keratin  and other similar materials this growth  state increases until  scp-003 takes on a form in the shape of  an opheride also known as a brittle star  an aquatic life form similar to a  starfish with five long thin appendages  protruding from a central body in the  case of  scp-003 this body appears to be the  computer's central processing unit in  this new form the biological motherboard  will also begin to create sensory organs  that will survey the area around it for  more materials to assimilate only  003-2 the stone slab is immune to being  converted into biological matter next  the second phase of transformation  occurs and  scp-003-1 begins to absorb organic  matter into its mass as well  living or otherwise if you've ever seen  the blob then you know what this looks  like and how horrifying it would be for  any person unfortunate enough to be  standing too close  during this stage  scp-003 will attempt to copy the biology  of a living organism it comes into  contact with and uses this template to  try and lure others towards it however  the biological motherboard appears to  use a lot of processing power to analyze  and assimilate organic matter and this  can actually diminish the speed at which  it increases in size so what happens to  003-2 the stone component of scp-003  during all of this when the biological  motherboard is growing in changing form  melding with other organisms as its  fleshy mass increases does 003-2 power  its transformation no  in fact it tries to prevent it that's  right the two components of  scp-003 do not work in tandem they work  against each other as the biological  motherboard starts to grow the stone  slab attached to it will emit  concentrated bursts of radiation these  radioactive emissions have a counter  effect on  003-1's ability to assimilate matter and  increase its size stopping the organic  mass of flesh from growing and even  reversing the process when the  temperature is raised to over 100  degrees celsius what we have so far is a  machine in two parts one that grows and  assimilates matter at lower temperatures  and the other that releases radiation to  stop this happening naturally the scp  foundation counteracts the anomalous  growing ability of 003-1 by keeping the  biological motherboard in a heated  containment environment still attached  to 003-2  under no circumstances is the  temperature of  scp-003's containment unit to drop below  35 degrees celsius and normally no  living person is permitted to make any  direct contact with the machine however  in the event of an emergency resulting  in a loss of power foundation staff are  required to huddle skin to skin with the  fleshing mass of the motherboard in an  attempt to keep it warm through their  own body heat much like how penguins  huddle together for warmth of course  those unlucky members of personnel  probably hope they can generate enough  heat between them to keep 003-1 from  starting to grow otherwise they'll know  they'll be the first that the biological  motherboard will absorb should a member  of personnel be chosen for this  particularly unpleasant task of being on  hand to keep zero zero three warm then  they will be made to submit for a full  examination beforehand no one can be  allowed close to scp-003 if they're  carrying any bodily parasites like  tapeworms or head lice they would all be  extra organisms for 003-1 to absorb  foundation staff are also required to be  decontaminated both before and after  directly dealing with scp-003  and of course no member of the scp  foundation is permitted to ever detach  the biological motherboard from the  stone component given that 003-2 is the  only device capable of reducing and  reversing  scp-003-1's growth  any changes in the pattern or color of  its glowing ruins is to be reported to  high-ranking members of the foundation  there have been multiple incidents  involving scp-003 though usually  occurring when staff working in the  foundation's m03 gloria research team  attempt to push the boundaries of the  device's anomalous properties their  interest in the biological motherboard  lies purely in seeing how the machine  evolves when allowed to grow beyond its  second brittle star stage during one  such incident  003-1 was allowed to grow and  restructure for just over 9 minutes  after which the containment area's  temperature was lowered and 003-2  released a massive continuous spike in  radiation any of the new material that  had been bonded to the biological  motherboard dissolved falling away and  turning into a dusty residue which was  then collected for testing at this point  both 003-1 and 003-2 seemed to power  down with no detectable activity the  stone slab did not power back on until  it was connected to an external power  generator when the same procedure was  repeated and 003-1 re-entered its growth  state  003-2's radiation appeared to be unable  to stop the motherboard from increasing  in mass when it reached 4 times its  original size by assimilating any and  all matter it could reach  scp-003 then began to change form in a  way 