umanity it  cannot understand pain or physical  sensation yet it is bent on remaking the  world into a paradise the whole effect  felt like words of some kind i believe  she wanted to see what we could  understand so she could understand us dr  moose said in her interview she didn't  have time to finish analyzing us i don't  know what would have happened if she had  now check out  scp-001 the broken god or boro cycle and  scp-1461 house of the worm for more  tales of anomalous machines with minds  of their own

